#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/graphweb/firefox.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"cbindgen\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libnotify\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libarchive\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"llvm\"/> (with clang, used for bindgen even if using gcc), <xref "
"linkend=\"nodejs\"/>, <xref linkend=\"pulseaudio\"/> (or <xref "
"linkend=\"alsa-lib\"/> if you edit the mozconfig; now deprecated by "
"mozilla), in either case please read the Configuration Information, and "
"<xref linkend=\"startup-notification\"/>"
